'''Classic Headwear''' (オシャレ笠, ''Oshare Kasa'', '''Fashionable Hats''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]].

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (M): Cannon gauge will be filled +4 steps/40% charged.

